{"id":69613,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69613"},"modified":"2026-10-27T14:59:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T13:59:50","slug":"campeonatos-regionais-de-corta-mato-viva-o-corta-mato","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/campeonatos-regionais-de-corta-mato-viva-o-corta-mato\/","title":{"rendered":"Campeonatos Regionais de Corta-mato \/ Viva o Corta-mato 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Campeonatos Regionais de Corta-mato \/ Viva o Corta-mato 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Campeonatos Regionais de Corta-mato \/ Viva o Corta-mato 2026<\/strong> realizam-se no dia <strong>7 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), a partir das <strong>14:00<\/strong>, no emblem\u00e1tico planalto do <strong>Ch\u00e3o das Feiteiras<\/strong> (freguesia do Porto da Cruz), no concelho de <strong>Machico<\/strong>, <strong>Ilha da Madeira<\/strong>. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o pontua para a <strong>Ta\u00e7a da Madeira<\/strong> e apura os campe\u00f5es regionais individuais e coletivos de corta-mato nos escal\u00f5es jovens, absolutos e veteranos.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Situado numa \u00e1rea montanhosa e verdejante sobranceira ao Porto da Cruz e ao Vale da Ribeira de Machico, o circuito do Ch\u00e3o das Feiteiras acolhe cinco corridas desdobradas por voltas de 1,5 km: o torneio <strong>Viva o Corta-Mato Sub-14<\/strong> (<strong>1,5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 14:00) e <strong>Sub-16<\/strong> (<strong>3,0 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 14:15), o <strong>Campeonato Regional de Sub-18 e Sub-20<\/strong> (<strong>4,5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 14:35) e os <strong>Campeonatos Regionais Absolutos Feminino<\/strong> (<strong>7,5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 15:10) e <strong>Masculino<\/strong> (<strong>7,5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 16:00), integrando atletas de Sub-23 a Veteranos (V35 a V75).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>AARAM \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira<\/strong>, o evento destina-se a atletas federados e serve de prova de apuramento regional para os Campeonatos Nacionais de Corta-Mato. Ser\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros clubes do escal\u00e3o absoluto, ao clube vencedor de Sub-18\/Sub-20 e do Viva o Corta-Mato, bem como medalhas aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados individuais de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ch\u00e3o das Feiteiras (Porto da Cruz), Machico, Ilha da Madeira<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break